OL,3,GNEWSABBC Look East presenter to leave
OL,4,Aafter 35 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC Look East presenter Susie
OL,7,FFowler-Watt has decided to hang up her
OL,8,Fearpiece for the final time as she
OL,9,Fprepares to leave the corporation after
OL,10,F35 years.
OL,12,FSusie, one of the longest-serving
OL,13,Fpresenters at the BBC, will host her
OL,14,Ffinal show on 18 December.
OL,16,FShe joined the BBC in 1991, becoming a
OL,17,Flead presenter in 1997, and said it had
OL,18,Fbeen a "privilege" to have "grown up"
OL,19,Falongside audiences.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
