OL,3,GNEWSABBC Look East presenter to leave
OL,4,Aafter 35 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobert Thompson, Director of Production
OL,7,Ffor BBC Local, said: "Susie has made an
OL,8,Foutstanding contribution to the BBC and
OL,9,Faudiences across the East of England."
